{"title":"Best fiction 2026","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/973892135/0/marginalrevolution~Best-fiction.html","date":1795505637000,"content":"<p>This year brought a remarkably strong showing in fiction.  Here is my list in the order I read them:</p>\r\n<p>Siri Hustvedt, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/what-ive-been-reading-288.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ghost Stories: A Memoir</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Karl Knausgaard, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/the-school-of-night.html\" target=\"_blank\">The School of Night</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Juan Marsé, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/last-evenings-with-teresa.html\" target=\"_blank\">Last Evenings with Teresa</a> [new translation]</p>\r\n<p>Claudia Piñeiro, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Cathedrals-Claudia-Pi%C3%B1eiro/dp/1917260288/ref=sr_1_1?crid=SG52MP17QWCV&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.Hu-QferChYhDEPWp5HEYnHhrFzkx1dg1gUSekcFZsro1oZzg1ryq87dqOgZkPMWcUysp8B6aoGzGsyyc7BY8SCWkEyn3L14hh3q0eqwqnyJ2RNKAxn_R2flh1wmFsku1m_h38bT6QLMxqp9eCbqhP4NV9OD1uBGOibG1Kbh4EF3KA3KruRN9gTJZv5VsFzG8Ig8Fbap1Q_b21bVqJJ5JM-fQGBt2rN0txwAcjaeVJOwP6ksoiIRenerbIxSrOknXHz3_Je4wSwsxNPuk_cH5B81RiV5jZKrd0FM05DFuF3A.F9aG1-_uCZlGaPG9-uQVU9ySChBiv4hY1paKHMRt49Y&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=Claudia+Pi%C3%B1eiro&amp;qid=1795349645&amp;sprefix=claudia+pi%C3%B1eiro%2Caps%2C683&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Cathedrals</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Christian Kracht, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/07/what-ive-been-reading-292.html\" target=\"_blank\">Eurotrash</a> [2025], and Air [2026].</p>\r\n<p>Munir Hachemi, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/08/what-ive-been-reading-294.html\" target=\"_blank\">The Mulai</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Egana Djabbarova, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/09/my-dreadful-body.html\" target=\"_blank\">My Dreadful Body</a>.</p>\r\n<p>China Mieville, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/what-ive-been-reading-296.html\" target=\"_blank\">The Rouse</a> (still reading this one).</p>\r\n<p>Ingeborg Bachmann and Max Frisch, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/We-Didnt-Very-Well-Correspondence/dp/1803096640/ref=sr_1_1?crid=XS5FHNB0PI8L&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.eqgX0lK3bTgrPTaeuy-lHqPCOwthPb_UHXvsLJ-u8MIXWyCVFgOw4NKRiOLmif3HeuWJyYRCatUwthBfnkhf93nsC5yquWQuh5djZk-SqXw3p7j380-4WUJxVZsWiDAmVxtFFiXn8DqGGdKuKz08pkT5zEr-q-S1EHjRRNUppEGdfjCdut43pEZ5kTFmy48k66qC04pfFVYS_S0jiffxwWlBAcHUrEXOerUHYRsAHwo.JH4i51O7OOZioF1FViC67Gv7Bi29Sy3ibtv2Unf2dqg&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=Ingeborg+Bachmann+and+Max+Frisch&amp;qid=1795349513&amp;sprefix=ingeborg+bachmann+and+max+frisch%2Caps%2C505&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">‘We Didn’t Do Very Well’: The Correspondence</a>.  Here are <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/09/mein-ingeborg-bachmann-studium.html\" target=\"_blank\">my remarks on the German-language edition</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Adolo Bioy Casares, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Morels-Invention-Adolfo-Bioy-Casares/dp/B0GGNLYS96/ref=sr_1_1?crid=2DYCM1TBC52BO&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.qIbqYA39c4XZt0O40n6iqErl6DZr1ty1EQT7RYcHJFNHL0y4pxggeMSYSenPjlxHPU2dwkvROS1889ve5ixbMTueWV3MdLC5QXm6HlLPj5ktXmk8QyJY7XafgxrvqBFxYVCvkk_gpqsIFR3if0KOZiup8Kmr4N9NFCOKbVNVMfGoe6SuhnMh8RNWSrVk0y16tX0faXqZhFRneD3oYBlqJ5I2N2BD6-dBFPyVS4eafGM.zSd2WQH7Z25bF7xJihxYy1-QXzue5uZCkNMiDBiPplA&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=morel%27s+invention+by+adolfo+bioy+casares&amp;qid=1795349588&amp;sprefix=morel%27s+inven%2Caps%2C140&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Morel’s Invention</a>, new translation by Margaret Jull Costa.</p>\r\n<p>Missouri Williams, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/what-ive-been-reading-298.html\" target=\"_blank\">The Vivisectors</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Mathias Enard, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/what-ive-been-reading-298.html\" target=\"_blank\">Perfecting the Shot</a>.</p>\r\n<p>M. John Harrison, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/what-ive-been-reading-298.html\" target=\"_blank\">The End of Everything</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Solvej Ball, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Calculation-Book-V-Solvej-Balle/dp/081124038X/ref=sr_1_1?crid=3GT8MBEP5BPBF&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.UfEYs0frpqxRucGNMTpDFzlPTb07Zpz4C74h_R1aMG5jW36OklQQk14FuH0zfIKMj0J5S-j7f3BtdPafSZ8kJWQEKVbsDVeA8tKAOs9FvFJEf0pTMAWhStpgPJeWn1SB.bl4g8dgv0ovDERrS8A2nJhKll5OBzhghwmhsxMQebII&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=On+the+Calculation+of+Volume+V&amp;qid=1795349472&amp;sprefix=%2Caps%2C130&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">On the Calculation of Volume V</a>, noting you cannot start at the fifth volume for this series.</p>\r\n<p>There is also a new Min Lee novel, and a new and short Jon Fosse novel, as possible contenders for this list.  I have not yet read them.  As for a “best of,” the Knausgaard and the Bachmann-Frisch correspondence stand out for me, Bioy Casares as well.</p>\r\n<p>What else?  I do believe we are entering an era where high quality fiction is more and more important.  I am delighted to see that our writers and translators are responding accordingly.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/best-fiction-2026.html\">Best fiction 2026</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/973892135/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/973892135/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/973892135/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/973892135/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/973892135/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/973892135/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/best-fiction-2026.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/best-fiction-2026.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/best-fiction-2026.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/best-fiction-2026.html#comment-161092263\">Every Exit Brings You Home, by Naeem Murr ...</a> <i>by OW</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/best-fiction-2026.html#